  message: "Fixed in commit 22f0f5129. Added size, length, copy, find to ambiguous_names in java.yaml. List.size()/Map.size()/String.length() etc. on unresolved-external destinations no longer match Files.size/File.length etc. Module-resolved calls (e.g., explicit java.nio.file.Files dst) still match. 3 new tests in TestAmbiguousNameFiltering."  # 78cb
